1. Grant
   Subject to the terms of this License, any person may obtain, use, copy,
   modify, merge, and distribute this software and derivative works free of
   charge for NON-COMMERCIAL purposes only.

2. Prohibition of Commercial Use
   Commercial use of this software, including modified or derivative versions,
   is NOT permitted without prior written permission from the copyright holder.
   Commercial use includes, without limitation:
     (a) selling, renting, or licensing the software;
     (b) including it in a paid product or paid service;
     (c) using it to provide fee-based diagnostic assistance, data analysis,
         or consulting services;
     (d) deploying it in the business operations of hospitals, clinics,
         pharmaceutical companies, insurers, or medical device vendors;
     (e) internal use that directly generates revenue.

   Commercial purpose means any activity by an individual, company, institution,
   or other organization aimed at profit. Academic research, teaching, personal
   study, non-profit projects, open-source integration, and non-profit research
   collaboration are NOT commercial purposes and are permitted.

3. Commercial Licensing
   For commercial use, a separate commercial license must be obtained from the
