   IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,
   FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE
   AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER
   LIABILITY ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE
   OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.

6. Medical Notice
   This software is a data-processing tool. It is NOT a medical device and does
   NOT provide diagnosis or treatment advice. It must not replace professional
   medical judgment. Users are solely responsible for compliance and for any
   clinical use.

7. Termination
   Any violation of this License terminates the grant automatically. Upon
